      "## Step 2: Ground your ideas in experience",
      "The most credible thought leadership draws on things you have done, seen or measured. Commentators can summarise a trend; practitioners can explain what happens when you actually try it. Keep a running list of lessons from your work, such as decisions, mistakes, surprises and patterns. These become the evidence behind your opinions.",
